  "main": "<main class=\"site-shell\" id=\"home\"><header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"site-name\" href=\"#home\">Sunghyun Park</a><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a class=\"active\" href=\"#home\">Home</a><a href=\"#publication\">Publication</a><a href=\"#projects\">Projects</a><a href=\"/cv.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">CV</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle light and dark mode\" title=\"Toggle light and dark mode\"><svg class=\"icon-moon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 14.5A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 9.5 4a8.5 8.5 0 1 0 10.5 10.5Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><svg class=\"icon-sun\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\"></circle><g stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2.6v2.2M12 19.2v2.2M2.6 12h2.2M19.2 12h2.2M5.4 5.4l1.6 1.6M17 17l1.6 1.6M18.6 5.4 17 7M7 17l-1.6 1.6\"></path></g></svg></button></nav></header><section class=\"intro\" aria-labelledby=\"intro-title\"><div class=\"portrait-wrap\"><img class=\"portrait\" src=\"/images/profile.jpg\" alt=\"Sunghyun Park\"/></div><div class=\"intro-copy\"><h1 id=\"intro-title\">Sunghyun Park</h1><div class=\"interest-list name-tags\"><span>Robot Learning</span><span>Learning-Based Control</span><span>Humanoid Control</span><span>Manipulation</span><span>Whole-Body Control</span></div><p class=\"affiliation\">B.E. Student, Mechanical Engineering · Yonsei University</p><p>Hi! I am an undergraduate student in Mechanical Engineering at Yonsei University. I&#x27;m interested in learning-based control for robots, with a focus on humanoid locomotion, manipulation, and whole-body control.</p><p>I am currently an undergraduate researcher at the<!-- --> <a href=\"https://mlcs.yonsei.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Machine Learning and Control Systems Laboratory</a>, advised by Prof. Jongeun Choi.</p><div class=\"profile-links\" aria-label=\"Profile links\"><a href=\"/cv.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">CV</a><a href=\"https://github.com/edipark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">GitHub</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sunghyun-park-a141bb332/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">LinkedIn</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@SunghyunPark-l3u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">YouTube</a></div><p class=\"contact-line\"><a href=\"mailto:edi_park@yonsei.ac.kr\">edi_park [at] yonsei.ac.kr</a><span>Seoul, Korea</span><span>Robotics · Control · AI</span></p></div></section><section class=\"content-section\" id=\"publication\" aria-labelledby=\"publication-title\"><h2 id=\"publication-title\">Publication &amp; Working Paper</h2><article class=\"publication-item\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"publication-image-trigger media-frame\" aria-label=\"Enlarge image: CoHuB multi-humanoid collaboration benchmark\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><img src=\"/images/cohub.jpg\" alt=\"CoHuB multi-humanoid collaboration benchmark\"/></button><dialog class=\"image-lightbox\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_6dbtb_\"><div class=\"lightbox-content\"><div class=\"lightbox-toolbar\"><p id=\"_R_6dbtb_\">CoHuB multi-humanoid collaboration benchmark</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"lightbox-close\" aria-label=\"Close image\" autofocus=\"\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><img class=\"lightbox-image\" src=\"/images/cohub.jpg\" alt=\"CoHuB multi-humanoid collaboration benchmark\"/><a class=\"lightbox-original\" href=\"/images/cohub.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open original image ↗</a></div></dialog><div class=\"publication-body\"><div class=\"publication-year\">2026</div><h3>CoHuB: A Simulation Benchmark for Multi-Humanoid Collaboration</h3><p>Hyunjin Park<sup>*</sup>, Jebeom Chae<sup>*</sup>, Minwoo Park<sup>*</sup>,<!-- --> <strong>Sunghyun Park</strong>, Hanjun Yoo, Seoyeon Choi, Soochul Yoo, Joohwan Seo, Sarmad Idrees, Jae-Sang Hyun, Jongmin Lee, Roberto Horowitz, Youngwoon Lee, Jongeun Choi</p><p class=\"venue\"><sup>*</sup> Co-first authors.</p><p class=\"venue\"><strong>Accepted to NeurIPS 2026 Robot Learning Workshop.</strong> Under review for ICLR 2027.</p><div class=\"item-links\"><a href=\"https://meat124.github.io/CoHuB/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Project</a></div></div></article><article class=\"publication-item\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"publication-image-trigger media-frame\" aria-label=\"Enlarge image: JOSE main figure\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"><img src=\"/images/JOSE_fig.png\" alt=\"JOSE main figure\"/></button><dialog class=\"image-lightbox\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_7dbtb_\"><div class=\"lightbox-content\"><div class=\"lightbox-toolbar\"><p id=\"_R_7dbtb_\">JOSE main figure</p><button type=\"button\" class=\"lightbox-close\" aria-label=\"Close image\" autofocus=\"\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><img class=\"lightbox-image\" src=\"/images/JOSE_fig.png\" alt=\"JOSE main figure\"/><a class=\"lightbox-original\" href=\"/images/JOSE_fig.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open original image ↗</a></div></dialog><div class=\"publication-body\"><div class=\"publication-year\">2026</div><h3>JOSE: Reconstructing Privileged State from Joint History for Humanoid Motion Control</h3><p><strong>Sunghyun Park</strong>, Hyeonjung Kim</p><p class=\"venue\">Submitted to ICRA 2027. Under review.</p><div class=\"item-links\"><a href=\"https://edipark.github.io/jose-humanoid/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Project</a><a href=\"https://github.com/edipark/jose-humanoid\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Code</a></div></div></article></section><section class=\"content-section\" id=\"projects\" aria-labelledby=\"projects-title\"><h2 id=\"projects-title\">Selected Projects</h2><div class=\"project-list\"><article class=\"project-item\"><div class=\"media-frame\"><video src=\"/videos/umma.mp4\" aria-label=\"UMMA project demonstration\" autoPlay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsInline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\"></video></div><div class=\"project-body\"><h3>UMMA: University Mobile Management Agent</h3><p>Built the robot&#x27;s control and task-execution stack in ROS2 for an autonomous building management system.</p><p class=\"project-tags\">ROS2 · YOLO · SLAM · Hardware Design</p><div class=\"item-links\"><a href=\"https://umma-yonsei.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Project</a></div></div></article><article class=\"project-item\"><div class=\"media-frame\"><video src=\"/videos/palma.mp4\" aria-label=\"PALMA project demonstration\" autoPlay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsInline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\"></video></div><div class=\"project-body\"><h3>PALMA: A Robotic Hand Project</h3><p>Fabricated every part in-house by 3D printing and assembled a fully tendon-driven hand with vision-based teleoperation.</p><p class=\"project-tags\">Computer Vision · Tendon Actuation</p><div class=\"item-links\"><a href=\"https://github.com/edipark/PALMA_teleop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Code</a></div></div></article><article class=\"project-item\"><div class=\"media-frame\"><video src=\"/videos/dextra.mp4\" aria-label=\"DEXTRA motion imitation GitHub project cover\" autoPlay=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" playsInline=\"\" preload=\"metadata\"></video></div><div class=\"project-body\"><h3>DEXTRA: A Low-Cost Bipedal Robot</h3><p>Designed, printed, and assembled a 12-DoF bipedal robot from scratch for under $800 in parts, trained to walk via DeepMimic-based motion imitation.</p><p class=\"project-tags\">Motion Retargeting · RL</p><div class=\"item-links\"><a href=\"https://github.com/edipark/Mimickit_Dextra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Code</a><a href=\"https://github.com/edipark/DEXTRA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Hardware</a></div></div></article></div></section><section class=\"content-section experience\" aria-labelledby=\"experience-title\"><h2 id=\"experience-title\">Research Experience</h2><div class=\"experience-item\"><div class=\"institution-logo\"><img src=\"/images/yonsei-logo.png\" alt=\"Yonsei University logo\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/></div><div class=\"experience-details\"><h3><a href=\"https://mlcs.yonsei.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Machine Learning and Control Systems Laboratory</a></h3><p>Undergraduate Researcher · Yonsei University</p></div><time>Nov. 2025 - Present</time></div><div class=\"experience-item\"><div class=\"institution-logo\"><img src=\"/images/snu-logo.png\" alt=\"Seoul National University logo\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"/></div><div class=\"experience-details\"><h3>Dynamic Robotic Systems Laboratory</h3><p>Undergraduate Intern · Seoul National University</p></div><time>Jul. 2025 - Sep. 2025</time></div></section><footer><span>© 2026 Sunghyun Park</span></footer></main>",
